/* ── Kiln · pomodoro focus timer tied to a task queue ─────────────────
   The timer is time-stamp based (end time, not decrementing ticks), so a
   hidden tab or an off-screen component never drifts. Frames only paint:
   they stop when the component leaves the viewport (IntersectionObserver)
   or the tab is hidden, and a single timeout fires the session end. The
